SUMMARY:Weird Harold Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Weird Harold returns to the Melon Ball this summer for one night only! \nHow does one describe Weird Harold? They’ve engaged and befuddled local audiences since the 1990’s with their loud\, raucous\, hard-rockin’\, quirky\, hilarious\, energetic\, entertaining\, indie alternative ear worms\, such as “I Drive a Monster Truck\,” “I Ruined Your Birthday\,” “I’ve Got a Bad Rash\,” and the Steinbeck “Of Mice and Men”-inspired “Be My Bunny.” Count on an evening of high-energy\, seventh-grade style double entendre potty humor\, and head-boppin\,’ eye-poppin’ entertainment! Weird Harold cannot be explained\, only experienced\, and no two shows are the same\, even if they perform the same set. They’re an act not to be missed. \n$20 General Admission
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/weird-harold-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, Suite #1\, Davis\, California\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Weird-Harold2-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:watermelonmusicdavis@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
